{
  "date": "2026-10-26",
  "user_observation": "Pointer starts smooth at 50\u201365 full-bar reports/s, becomes jumpy during combat and stays jumpy on returning to the menu while the displayed rate stays 50\u201365/s. No physical recording has yet confirmed which code path causes that session.",
  "confirmed_code_fixes": [
    "Publish snapshots from native input callbacks at a bounded aggregate 120 packets/s; retain 10 Hz heartbeats and timer flush of coalesced states. Scope a low-latency activity to live controller input, releasing it on disconnect/exit while allowing idle system sleep.",
    "Match one-point recovery to the nearest plausible endpoint rather than blindly trusting camera slot identity. Refuse ambiguous midpoint matches.",
    "Validate acquired pair length/orientation, using bounded one-end recovery when two detected lights no longer resemble the acquired bar. Coherent fast translations and full reacquisition remain supported.",
    "Retain smoothing history through brief losses instead of resetting on every null IR snapshot; longer losses, disconnects, remote replacement and recalibration reset it.",
    "Reject isolated screen-position spikes with a three-measurement median; derive adaptive smoothing from measured velocity and camera sample timestamps rather than distance to the latest target. Reticle, turret and shots retain the same aim source.",
    "Add opt-in, bounded 60-second anonymous recordings to separate sensor noise, frame timing and UDP backlog during physical testing."
  ],
