    "The physical before capture confirms the delivery gap. Post-fix rate and smooth combat aiming were confirmed by the user; no second raw after recording was required. Background App Nap was not independently isolated from other timer scheduling.",
    "A healthy full-bar report rate does not measure positional accuracy. Continuous coherent false readings, physical visibility or interference can still need investigation.",
    "The median adds about one camera-report interval for a new direction. In synthetic tests, 60 Hz camera sweeps settle within about 29\u201333 ms at 60\u2013240 display FPS; the 30-FPS case takes about 67 ms.",
    "Some existing smoke tests retain ObjectDB/resource teardown warnings. Their passing assertions are not a claim that all logs are warning-free.",
    "Native Bluetooth pairing, output reports, Nunchuk decoding, controller mappings, physical calibration values and gameplay parameters are unchanged."
  ],
